  unitName: Creation God Odin
  unitId: 750317
  unitNumber: 8601
  description: "All-Father Odin is chief among the gods of Valhalla, and the most
    respected among them. Along with his wife Frigg, he is the undisputed ruler of
    the realm, credited with the creation of the fierce and valorous Valkyries.Many
    tales speak of Odin's exploits as a mighty warrior\u2014how his legendary spear
    Gungnir can utterly destroy any creature. But few know of the spear's secret
    power of creation, which the All-Father harnessed to form all manners of life.
    His goal was to create the ultimate protector of Valhalla, an infallible guardian
    to last all time.Behind the All-Father's commendable appearance, however, lies
    a deep-rooted anxiety. Odin fears nothing except an old prophecy speaking of
    a cataclysmic event known as Ragnarok, for even the gods must tremble at a fate
    unknown..."
  summonDesc: Valhalla is under my protection!<br>None shall threaten its sanctity.
  fusionDesc: Should Ragnarok come upon us,<br>I fear we may have no recourse.<br>But
    we must always stand ready...
  evoDesc: The weight of all the worlds rests upon my shoulders...
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
